{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day X is an immersive, interactive fiction adventure told in a gripping graphic novel style. Step into the boots of Jason Miller, a Navy SEAL caught in the chaos of a nuclear strike on the United States\u2014just as a deadly bioweapon is unleashed, turning men into flesh-eating monsters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As the story unfolds, you control the narrative\u2014every decision you make shapes your path. Choose wisely, as your actions can unlock new storylines, forge unexpected alliances, or lead you to a sudden, deadly end.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With multiple branching storylines, life-and-death decisions, and several unique endings, this is more than just a story\u2014it's your own gripping, choose-your-own-adventure. Read, decide, and survive.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681890?t=1748510286","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681890/c0d35d6f5cc916430f4521d75237c6f92597adb0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748510286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681890/f92d088c17e3c100e760c319b1d4eea472ec5155/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748510286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681890/f92d088c17e3c100e760c319b1d4eea472ec5155/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748510286","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There are depictions of people being shot. Zombies. Depictions of cartoon/comic bodies."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day X is an immersive, interactive fiction adventure told in a gripping graphic novel style. Step into the boots of Jason Miller, a Navy SEAL caught in the chaos of a nuclear strike on the United States\u2014just as a deadly bioweapon is u